From 16dbc8984306c063ab9fee2091d1eae64efaee1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maciej Dudek <mdudek@antmicro.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Sep 2025 17:48:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Change ahb_lsu_dma_bridge behavior

This commit changes 'ahb_lsu_dma_bridge' module behavior. Previously it
converted incoming AHB transactions to AXI, then routed them using
'axi_lsu_dma_bridge' module, and for DMA traffic it converted them back
to the AHB. New behavior keeps AHB protocol throughout the bridge,
removing delays. This changed also required changing 'lmem' from always
using 'axi_slv', to use either 'axi_slv', or 'ahb_sif' based on the VeeR
configuration.

Signed-off-by: Maciej Dudek <mdudek@antmicro.com>
---
 testbench/ahb_lsu_dma_bridge.sv | 339 +++++---------------------------
 testbench/ahb_sif.sv            |  67 ++++---
 testbench/tb_top.sv             | 165 ++++++----------
 3 files changed, 152 insertions(+), 419 deletions(-)

